>> title: Dal Tadka
>> category: Soups
>> tags: lentils, indian, vegetarian, stovetop
>> counters: Curry House
>> aka: daal tadka, tarka dal, dal tarka, dal fry, dhal tadka, tempered lentils
>> servings: 4
>> time: 1 hr

>> step: simmer 45 min, whisk smooth
Simmer @toor dal{1%cup}(200 g; rinsed) for ~{45%min} with @water{4%cups}(950 mL; top up as it thickens), @ground turmeric{1/2%tsp}, and @kosher salt{1%tsp}, then whisk it smooth.

>> step: fry 1 min
Fry @cumin seeds{1%tsp} and @dried red chiles{2} in @ghee{3%Tbs} until fragrant, ~{1%min}.

>> step: cook 6 min
Cook @&(~1)tadka{} for ~{6%min} with @onion{1%small}(finely chopped), @ginger-garlic paste{1%Tbs}, and @tomato{1%medium}(chopped).

>> step: simmer 5 min
Pour @&(~1)masala{} over @&(~3)dal{} and simmer ~{5%min}.

>> step: finish
Finish @&(~1)dal{} with @cilantro{2%Tbs} and @lemon juice{1%Tbs}.
